  "content_html": "<div id=\"main\">\n\t\t<section id=\"primary\">\n\t\t\t<div id=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-div divider\">\t\t\t\t\n<article id=\"post-326\" class=\"post-326 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-javascript\">\n\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/326/meta-programming-in-javascript\" title=\"Permalink to Meta-programming in JavaScript\" rel=\"bookmark\">Meta-programming in JavaScript</a></h2>\n    <p class=\"entry-posted\">\n      <time datetime=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" title=\"2014-05-14T10:01:17+00:00\" class=\"published\">\n        <a title=\"See all posts from May, 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2012/07\" class=\"posted-month\">7月</a>\n        <span class=\"posted-date\">02</span>\n        <a title=\"See all posts from 2014\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/date/2012\" class=\"posted-year\">2012</a>\n      </time>\n    </p>\n      \t\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n      <div id=\"author-meta\">\n        <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/author/tleemozilla-com\">\n          <img src=\"http://www.gravatar.com/avatar/83c5676592010b72c4d7565d06a68c82?d=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/wp-content/plugins/avatar/mystery-man.jpg&amp;s=24\" alt=\"\" class=\"avatar user-13-avatar\" width='24' height='24' /><div id=\"author-info\">Thinker (清都山水郎)</div>\n        </a>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"post-date\">\n                  </div>\n      </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content \">\n\t\t\r\n如大家所熟知，JavaScript 是一種具有許多特性的動態語言，能應用於 meta-programming ，換句話說，其可以操作程式及改變程式。Meta-programming 的能力在於動態 (runtime) 改變和定義程式的行為，具有高效率的表達程式結構和邏輯的優點。然而，meta-programming 是一把兩面刃，善者如倚天劍、屠龍刀；劣者則是一套七傷拳，使程式如無字天書。然而.....<a class=\"more\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/326/meta-programming-in-javascript\">深入了解</a>  \n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n\t\n  <footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n            <div class=\"entry-category-box\">\n      文章分類：\n      <a href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/category/javascript\" title=\"觀看分類「Javascript」的全部文章\" rel=\"category tag\">Javascript</a>    </div>\n        <div class=\"entry-social-box\">\n      社群分享：\n     <div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/326/meta-programming-in-javascript\" data-layout=\"button_count\" data-width=\"40\" data-show-faces=\"false\" data-font=\"arial\"></div>     <!-- Place this tag where you want the +1 button to render. -->\n     \n     <div class=\"google-share\"><div class=\"g-plusone\" name=\"gplus\" data-size=\"medium\" data-annotation=\"bubble\" data-width=\"40\" data-href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/326/meta-programming-in-javascript\"></div></div>     \n    <div class=\"pinterest-share\"><a href=\"http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/326/meta-programming-in-javascript&media=http://mozilla.com.tw/assets/css/img/mozcomtw/channels-firefox.png\" data-pin-do=\"buttonPin\" data-pin-config=\"none\" data-pin-color=\"red\" class=\"pin-it-button\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"//assets.pinterest.com/images/PinExt.png\" title=\"Pin It\" /></a></div>      <div class=\"plurk-share\">\n        <a href=\"javascript: void(window.open('http://www.plurk.com/?qualifier=shares&status=' .concat(encodeURIComponent('http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/326/meta-programming-in-javascript')) .concat(' ') .concat('&#40;') .concat(encodeURIComponent(document.title)) .concat('&#41;')));\">\n          <img src=\"http://statics.plurk.com/2980c7bcb4eb012159e7701a61cb2e75.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"plurk share\">\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"comment-share\">\n        <a class=\"comment-button\" href=\"http://tech.mozilla.com.tw/posts/326/meta-programming-in-javascript#respond\">留言<div class=\"count-bubble\">0</div></a>\n      </div>\n 